{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18252","headline":"送郑尚书赴南海 · 韩愈","name":"送郑尚书赴南海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"番禺军府盛，欲说暂停桮。\n盖海旗幢出，连天观阁开。\n衙时龙户集，上日马人来。\n风静鶢鶋去，官廉蚌蛤廻。\n货通师子国，乐奏武王台。\n事事皆殊异，无嫌屈大才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}